# Qt Linguist catalogs, not TypeScript. Linguist goes by the extension and
# counts every .ts file as TypeScript. The tree holds no TypeScript, so the
# rule covers each catalog, the app's translations and the test fixtures'
# alike.
*.ts linguist-language=XML
